  "reported": "Autorun as Masinissa, Marathon, save 'Masinissa BC-0410.CivBeyondSwordSave' (410 BC, game turn 269): landing works; settler mechanics unripe; AI not valuing key buildings and technologies; endless 'Waiting for other players'; worse time complexity",
  "root_causes": {
    "endless_turn": "a lone Javelineer with a worker job pathed onto an enemy-held tile; groupMove without MOVE_THROUGH_ENEMY split it into a new group each update slice, CvPlayerAI::AI_unitUpdate stopped at it every slice and no moves were spent",
    "turn_time": "path searches: pathValid recomputed the parent-plot tests for every neighbour; AI_explore ran a whole-map search per candidate; AI_exploreRange searched plots beyond its range; recursive upgrade-tree walks",
    "settlers": "site counts and AI_found ignored whether a site could be reached from the settler's region (foreign borders, no transport); settlers without sites were never disbanded; lone settlers in threatened cities got no escort; a transport without escort at sea waited forever",
    "spearman_pump": "the minimal-garrison rule counts only UNITAI_CITY_DEFENSE units; Spearmen cannot take that role, so cities without Archery or Bronze Working trained attack-role Spearmen at every production decision",
    "gold_target": "AI_goldTarget scaled elapsed turns by the speed's price multiplier although slow speeds already have more turns; the liquidity cap used the research percent"
  },
